{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note : </strong>It's demo version of &quot;Co-Ape : Rise Of The Monke&quot;. Enjoy the limited experience.\u00a0If you enjoyed it, you can add it to your wishlist to be notified when the full version is released.<br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong>In this demo, you can climb up to 400 meters. There are 3 different sections. In the full version, this number exceeds 1500 meters with a minimum of 6 sections!<br><br><br><strong>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke \u2013 Two Minds, One Ape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>unique co-op climbing game</strong>, the <strong>controls</strong> are <strong>entirely in your and your friend's hands</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the test subject T-073 as two researchers.<br> <br><strong>Your goal is</strong> to overcome challenging levels with <strong>different mechanics and reach the top</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Single-Player or Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control</strong> T-073 entirely on <strong>your own</strong> or <strong>team up with a friend</strong> to <strong>share control</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Split Controls for Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">T-073's brain is no longer normal! <br>Each hemisphere now functions independently and <strong>without communication</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Left Brain:</strong> Controls the <strong>Camera</strong>, <strong>Jumping</strong>, and <strong>Interactions</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Right Brain:</strong> Controls the\u00a0<strong>Movement</strong> and <strong>Running</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your side and start playing!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Difficulty Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal and Hardcore mode.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uniquely Designed Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each level</strong> introduces <strong>new mechanics</strong> and <strong>obstacles</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb</strong> to <strong>the</strong> <strong>top</strong> <strong>alone or with a friend</strong> and <strong>reach the</strong> <strong>final point</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600540?t=1742828583","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600540?t=1742828583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/2435bdc1ea46b709f7bef727567fe64010535d40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742828583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/2435bdc1ea46b709f7bef727567fe64010535d40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742828583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note : </strong>It's demo version of &quot;Co-Ape : Rise Of The Monke&quot;. Enjoy the limited experience.\u00a0If you enjoyed it, you can add it to your wishlist to be notified when the full version is released.<br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong>In this demo, you can climb up to 400 meters. There are 3 different sections. In the full version, this number exceeds 1500 meters with a minimum of 6 sections!<br><br><br><strong>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke \u2013 Two Minds, One Ape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <strong>unique co-op climbing game</strong>, the <strong>controls</strong> are <strong>entirely in your and your friend's hands</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of the test subject T-073 as two researchers.<br> <br><strong>Your goal is</strong> to overcome challenging levels with <strong>different mechanics and reach the top</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Single-Player or Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Control</strong> T-073 entirely on <strong>your own</strong> or <strong>team up with a friend</strong> to <strong>share control</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Split Controls for Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">T-073's brain is no longer normal! <br>Each hemisphere now functions independently and <strong>without communication</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Left Brain:</strong> Controls the <strong>Camera</strong>, <strong>Jumping</strong>, and <strong>Interactions</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Right Brain:</strong> Controls the\u00a0<strong>Movement</strong> and <strong>Running</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your side and start playing!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Difficulty Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal and Hardcore mode.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uniquely Designed Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each level</strong> introduces <strong>new mechanics</strong> and <strong>obstacles</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb</strong> to <strong>the</strong> <strong>top</strong> <strong>alone or with a friend</strong> and <strong>reach the</strong> <strong>final point</strong>!</p>","developers":["DepthinVision"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3600150","name":"Co-Ape : Rise Of The Monke"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/e6a86d9c451cf71898f1a924525976504